<title>USA: Advanced Marketing names Carter CFO.</title>
<headline>Advanced Marketing names Carter CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Marketing Services Inc said it appointed Daniel Carter chief financial officer, succeeding Jon Fish, who resigned on June 30 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Carter is a certified public accountant who spent the last three years as chief financial officer of Price Enterprises Inc.</p>
</text>
